Falsifies `address_space_map::verification::every_address_below_the_ceiling_lies_in_exactly_one_band`.

The defect: `SERVICE_WINDOWS` starts one page below the heap's end, so the two bands share a page.
The `const` tiling assert in `lib.rs` would stop the build first, so the patch deletes it as well:
what this shows is that the harness catches an overlap on its own.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert_eq!(bands_containing(virtual_address), 1)`, at `virtual_address = 0x4FFF_F000..0x5000_0000`.

diff --git a/crates/address_space_map/src/lib.rs b/crates/address_space_map/src/lib.rs
